      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>The character unconsciously spends Blood Traits at inappropriate times without meaning to &mdash; boosting Physical Traits mid-conversation, or waking up a Blood Trait short with no memory of why.</p><p><strong>Trigger/Effect:</strong> Once per session, the Storyteller may simply inform the player that the character is missing a Blood Trait without further explanation.</p><p><em>Source: Clanbook: Malkavian, New Derangements.</em></p>",
